1067:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_uart.c ****         (+) HAL_UART_Transmit()
1068:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_uart.c ****         (+) HAL_UART_Receive()
